{"name":"RobinCat Radar","repo":"nancyc0813-maker/robincat-radar","at":"2026-11-04T20:16:43.039Z","seq":1793823403039,"version":"1.0.2","notes":["v1.0.2：看盘卡片和代币详情会显示「🎙 KOL 持有几位」（AVE 持有人前 100 名里被标成 KOL 的钱包），详情还会列出捆绑、阴谋集团、钓鱼等风险标签。","v1.0.2：新增买入条件「KOL 持有」（一般新币和 Robinhood 链都有）：开关＋你自己填人数，预设关；读不到资料时照你选的「不买」或备用条件，每一步都写进判断日志。","v1.0.2：引擎忙（节点慢、开机补扫）时，手动卖单／买单不会再被误退回「引擎没在跑」。","v1.0.2：钱包登出时 TG 只发一则通知（含重新连接的连结和配对码），不再连发两则不同的提醒。","v1.0.2：按「立即更新」等不到结果时会跳视窗说明原因、可以直接查看日志；更新完雷达自动重开后会提示「已更新到新版」；更新讯息补齐英文。","v1.0.2：反馈／绑定／邀请画面加注明：官方机器人 @RobinCatRadar_bot 只收反馈和绑定，不能下单、不能查余额，遥控雷达要用你自己的 TG 机器人。","v1.0.2：看盘长时间开着不会再越来越卡（币图示快取设上限）。"],"files":{"watch.mjs":"f377566ca36688303d3379a690e244ec907f01cbe18901fd19789b755cc37116","bind.mjs":"e02edbe122cbc236f50dee964400dcc4ce6a863ff5f4b106109ce5e0cf85c308","rh.mjs":"b652ae8c66180e243dee8b1fbc0426948ef3e897bd6bb6df8b15b5024f31f6df","plugins.mjs":"fa6abaaa08e5d846411bd32db7e189659d3be5a65989965d2af12a5d81414f93","plugin-host.mjs":"3fb0703563d063f652d83180be7046cc27bf6d50801fb031a67d6d5eb4c3587b","journal.mjs":"d39e9968896d241e403f050dfed83b95959de64f44c9ddd738390ede8c66ed14","weekly.mjs":"29607307001098f6fc275fb36e19e71e7ec47797b1fd68fb8002a335bd2c2ca9","smart.mjs":"b572118e5f359776d792fa87eec753dbc2329c1b39067790cf38876cb8900fe1","smartfind.mjs":"355c73285478b143ea5f715bf7dc710958632dace833deffdd3ac3b3405440d9","bscnft.mjs":"ee73aaaf2ad3c0df1c06fb42d83858327b26083ad967870e91765fccc4a174ed","bscanal.mjs":"68f69c5b138cba56b0c50afa6847ed73e45a58bc9fb174d6b8aaf114aafaaae6","air.mjs":"276e908fe0a4dc93b77620997d1f9e1a0bed83fa648af490140e13039d1d090f","ave.mjs":"c91d383211108a39887bde4e6b9921aa1930537bc46ef40af6372237c5f9c9a0","login.mjs":"8999aa8cb9521cdd3553a1c04d102acc4d0f4b1bf7e1ec15f868912d167cc4bb","setup.mjs":"50105c2abacbe3cd910e13eba09ec24c459d1892037288254f0e1ed737af6b56","repo.cjs":"dff6ac23ac9f445560e64b0bf83a47db82f7b5dd22d8c9acdcb9152c1210ff02","mintpick.mjs":"651b609a23e55e4f509333b20c3ad2ea6bf99aa067f001171ab157f0c9058798","sentinel.mjs":"f7171b